abla}\cdot(pu\vec{v})dV=-\iiint_{\infty} rac{\partial p}{\partial x}dV+\iiint_{\infty}pf_{x}dV\\iiint_{\infty}\left[ rac{\partial(pu)}{\partial t}+\overrightarrow{
abla}\cdot(pu\vec{v})\vec{v}ight]dV=\iiint_{\infty}\left(- rac{\partial p}{\partial x}+pf_{x}+\underline{\Gamma_{ux}}^{\prime}ight)dV\ rac{\partial(pu)}{\partial t}+\overrightarrow{
abla}\cdot(pu\vec{v})=- rac{\partial p}{\partial x}+pf_{x}+F_{visx}^{\prime} 因为被积函数是恒等的，所以可以把积分符号去掉，就是篮框的形式，因为有三个分量，所以 NS 公式有三条 ∂(pu)∂t+∇→⋅(puv→)=−∂p∂x+pfx+Fvisx′∂(pu)∂t+∇→⋅(puv→)=−∂p∂y+pfy+Fvisy′∂(pw)∂t+∇→⋅(pwv→)=−∂p∂z+pfz+Fvisz′{ egin{aligned} rac{\partial\left(puight)}{\partial t}+\overrightarrow{
abla}\cdot\left(pu\overrightarrow{v}ight)&=- rac{\partial p}{\partial x}+pf_x+F_{visx}^{\prime}\ rac{\partial\left(puight)}{\partial t}+\overrightarrow{
abla}\cdot\left(pu\overrightarrow{v}ight)&=- rac{\partial p}{\partial y}+pf_y+F_{visy}^{\prime}\ rac{\partial\left(pwight)}{\partial t}+\overrightarrow{
abla}\cdot\left(pw\overrightarrow{v}ight)&=- rac{\partial p}{\partial z}+pf_z+F_{visz}^{\prime}\end{aligned}} 笔记 模拟

